[ENG]Psst.
[ENG]Hey you.
[ENG]You're a human right?
- Why can I understand you?
	label MainPath
	[ENG]I've studied all about your species.
	[ENG]I'm the only one here who can understand what you're saying. Everyone else speaks Yokai Standard.
	label Info
	[ENG]Any questions?
	- How do I get outta here?
		[ENG]I believe there is a portal that goes back to Earth. But you need a password for the door.
		[ENG]I can't really remember it but I'm sure some Yokai here would know.
		[ENG]All I know is it is 4 words.
		jump Info
	- What is this place?
		[ENG]This is the Spirit Auction.
		[ENG]We meet once every few hundred years and have an auction.
		[ENG]We find some interesting things and bid on them.
		[ENG]What?
		[ENG]You think that's weird?
		[ENG]The proceeds go to charity so keep your judgement to yourself.
		jump Info
	- I'm good.
		[ENG]Cool. Oh yeah. If you don't get back to your home before the auction ends, you'll be stuck here until the next auction.
		[ENG]That will be in... about 240 years.
		[ENG]That's pretty soon though.
		[ENG]Hm? You don't live that long?
		[ENG]Wow. Only 80 years if you're lucky?
		[ENG]That's rough. I would find the portal if I were you.
		[ENG]You should take this with you. It's the second part of a dictionary series I used to learn your language.
		[ENG]You can use the translations to help you communicate with some of the others.
		[signal arg="DICTIONARY2"]
- Says who?
	[ENG]Hey hey, take it easy man. I was just curious.
	jump MainPath